{"created_at": "2026-11-14T02:00:00Z", "created_by": "ai", "from_version": "MARU-EP04-v2", "to_version": "MARU-EP04-v3", "project_id": "MARU-EP04", "items": [{"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfngtfz0a9ojpuz", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "絵ごとに寄る動きをやめ、絵は止めて置く（全部）。", "new_t": 41.8, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 41.8, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "少しずつ拡大して、また少し引いて少しずつ拡大してみたいなカメラの動きやめて", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnjryoj3p8sbxd", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "寄る動きをやめた（全部の絵）。", "new_t": 140.2, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 140.2, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "ここも少しずつ拡大して戻って少しずつ拡大するのやめて", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnmg495hofe8co", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "数字に「正解」「時間」の名前を付けた。", "new_t": 242.3, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 242.3, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "5ー8わり、ほぼ全部が何の数かわかるようにして", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnpldlct3nen06", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "ニュース・買い物・動画の絵に名前を付けた。怪しい記録は、同じ買い物の印が並んで「同じことを何百回も」。", "new_t": 364.1, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 364.1, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "表現がわかりにくい", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfntd3i7z2pgas7", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "青い点をやめ、「人らしさ」の目盛りと「選び方も見ている」の札に。", "new_t": 455.4, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 455.4, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "ここの青い点で表現してるのわかりにくい", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnu18qt6uky7wn", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "自作のチャットの印（本物のロゴは使わない）。2023年は「GPT-4」、2025年は「ChatGPT」と名前。", "new_t": 472.8, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 472.8, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "チャットGPTのアイコンにして", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnulohpz64nsle", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "分けた字幕の替わる所を、声の出ている割合で選ぶ形に（「OpenAIが」を言う前に替わる）。全 26 か所が声の切れ目に入ることを確かめた。", "new_t": 475.4, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 475.4, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "字幕（テロップ）の出るのが遅い", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnvg0bxkx8ates", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "吹き出しのしっぽを太い三角に。", "new_t": 508.1, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 508.1, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "吹き出しのしっぽ細すぎる", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnx02rurpzlhoj", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "分けた字幕の替わる所を、声の出ている割合で選ぶ形に（「先へ進んで…」は言うときに出る）。", "new_t": 565.9, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 565.9, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "字幕（テロップ）の出るのが早い", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnxk5ycdd58sat", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "門番が伏せて、目を閉じて、半ばあきらめている絵に。", "new_t": 577.7, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 577.7, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "犬が伏せて半ば諦めているような感じで", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfny16ok2gvq44m", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "まっすぐな足あとの上を歩くまるロボの絵を足した。", "new_t": 585.2, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 585.2, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "まっすぐ歩くまるロボだして", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnylaucwacdw05", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "門のない床と、遠くで目盛りを持って見ている門番の絵に（v5 でさらに直した）。", "new_t": 596.2, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 596.2, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "ここの表現わかんない", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnz0aw5tyie9f1", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "足あと（動き方）→ 記録帳（これまでの記録）と、前に出た絵で見せる。", "new_t": 607.4, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 607.4, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "ここもわかりにくい", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnze3if7c647jr", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "昔のテストと今の足あとを並べた絵に。", "new_t": 618.4, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 618.4, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "ここの表現わかりにくい", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfnzo63nutk91uc", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "賢くなる AI → 見分ける方法（ゆがんだ文字✕・絵のテスト✕・ふるまい？）。", "new_t": 624.0, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 624, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "ここも表現わかりにくい", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfo073oofnszvr5", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "まるロボが左右に傾く絵を交互に出す。", "new_t": 640.2, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 640.2, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "ここフラフラするまるロボにしてね", "reason": ""}, {"action": "fixed", "comment_id": "cmwfo0iofkmxxqgqz", "comment_rev": 1, "explain": "10:42.5 で終わるようにした（v5 でオープニング 2 秒を足して 10:44.5）。", "new_t": 644.1, "new_t_end": null, "new_version_id": "MARU-EP04-v3", "original_t": 644.1, "original_t_end": null, "original_text": "10分42.5秒くらいで動画終わらせて", "reason": ""}]}